<title>GERMANY: Hochtief Jan-May incoming orders up.</title>
<headline>Hochtief Jan-May incoming orders up.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First five months of calendar year 1997.</p>
<p>(in billions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4.7     up 5.4 pct</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			    5.2     up 2.8 pct</p>
<p>    Order book				   13.8    up 17.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Hochtief AG.</p>
</text>
